WEBVTT

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.020
Are you nervous?

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.360
No.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.870
I'm surprisingly calm as well.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.820
I wonder if we're calm
because our sisters are here...

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.620
Of course that's true, but...

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.160
...to me, that's not the only reason.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.160
I was able to come this far because of you.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.790
Leah-<i>chan</i>...

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.660
Let's dedicate this song to that 
special person in our lives.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.660
Let's dedicate this song to that 
special person in our lives.

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:50.270
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:00.910
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.870
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:11.590
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.260
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:31.190
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.320
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:36.110
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:43.910
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:52.340
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:01:52.340 --> 00:02:00.430
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.760
<i>We got dream</i>

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.230
--A concert?
--Here?!

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:09.850
Yeah.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:16.690
I'd like to hold a concert with Leah-<i>chan</i>
and show it to Sarah-<i>san</i> and my sis.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:17.820
Can you do it?

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.950
I don't know...

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:24.870
But if we could, I thought that
it may cheer Leah-<i>chan</i> up.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.080
How're you gonna prepare for it?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.910
That's...

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.550
That sounds interesting, <i>zura</i>.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.630
Yep, yep... Wait, what?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.670
I'll give you guys a hand, <i>zura</i>.

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:40.930
Really?! Then, after this,
I'm supposed to meet up with Leah-<i>chan</i>.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.550
Could you come along?

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:43.390
Sure.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.390
Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>...

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.730
You're coming too, of course,
right, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.100
M-Me?!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.440
--I have far more
important matters to attend to.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.770
--Okay then, you can eat my <i>yakitori</i>, <i>zura</i>.
Let's go, Ruby-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.
--I have far more important matters to attend to.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.280
--Okay then, you can eat my <i>yakitori</i>, <i>zura</i>.
Let's go, Ruby-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.
--My quest for little demons is one steeped in nobility.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.150
--Okay. Thank you, Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>.
--My quest for little demons
is one steeped in nobility.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.480
--Okay. Thank you, Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>.
--But if you really cannot do it without--

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.990
Ahh! Wait for me! Oh, and it's Yohane!

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.990
"Yakitori Meal"

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:13.230
Leah, I'm going shopping,
so could you look after the restau--

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.680
You didn't tell me that
these two would come, too.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.260
Ah, but Hanamaru-<i>chan</i> and Yoshi--

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.270
I mean, Yohane-<i>chan</i>,
are both dependable, so...

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:34.770
I don't care. I'm not really someone
who likes hanging out with people.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.350
I don't like to either, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.110
And Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> here is like
the poster child for solitude, <i>zura</i>.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.660
It's Yohane! Why are you saying
terrible things about me so nonchalantly?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.560
"<i>Zura</i>"?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.790
Ah! It's like my habit.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:52.040
--Seriously?
--I know it sounds weird, <i>zura</i>. I just...

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.120
That's Zuramaru's habit.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.000
That's why she would shut herself up
in the library with Ruby.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:58.960
Is that true?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:04.220
<i>Zura</i>... I was like that up until
the past spring, but...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:10.060
I'm pretty much... like that at school, so...

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:15.480
As for Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>,
she didn't even come to sch--

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.320
You don't have to give her
a play-by-play of my life! And it's Yohane!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.440
--I'm sorry, Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.
--Like I said, it's Yohane!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:26.870
"I won't give in no matter what happens."

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:30.290
"I shall stand on that summit
alongside the one I love,

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.830
and yell out in triumph without fail."

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.250
I told you! My sister is usually the one
who comes up with the lyrics and music!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.210
We haven't said anything yet.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:46.430
In any case, there's no twist or anything.
It's kind of too straightforward.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.510
What? Got a problem with that?

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.220
But it gives us an idea of what
kind of song you want to sing, <i>zura</i>.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:55.480
I'll help you, so let's 
create a song together.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:58.950
But you guys have to prepare
for the Love Live final round, right?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.320
Can you afford the time
to create a song with me?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.790
Well...

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:08.280
Ruby-<i>chan</i> wants to help you
no matter what, Leah-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.790
After talking to you
and my sister, I thought that

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:17.250
maybe we should show them
we can do things by ourselves,

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.890
so that they can graduate
without having to worry about us.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.300
Ugh! It's from Lili!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.970
She said, "Where are you? You should
be getting ready to go home."

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:28.760
"Little Demon Lili: Don't call me Lili!"
"What's with that name anyway?!"

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.180
She read my mind?!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.850
It's already that late?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:34.270
What're you going to do?

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.310
We're on winter break right now.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.770
--So?
--So...

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.730
You're staying?!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.520
Yep.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.570
That's right, <i>zura</i>.
Leah-<i>chan</i> is feeling very sad,

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.530
so we'd like to cheer her up
a little more, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:51.280
That's right. She's super-mega bummed out.
We can't leave her like that.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.280
Yep.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.540
Where are you staying?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:57.040
Fortunately, Leah-<i>chan</i>'s room is
big enough for all of us, so we'll stay there.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.620
Wow, that sounds kinda fun!

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.090
It does. Then why don't we also--

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:04.210
Ahh, her room isn't that big,
or how should I put it...?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.550
That's right, <i>zura</i>! In addition, Leah-<i>chan</i>
is really sensitive right now, <i>zura</i>!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.300
I-I see.

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:15.470
I'm sorry, sis. We'll definitely
be back in two or three days.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.480
I don't really care either way.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.690
I think it's fine.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:27.510
I'm sure the first years have a lot
to talk about amongst themselves. Right?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.580
I'm glad we came.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.620
Yeah, definitely. I've come
to realize that unbeknownst to us,

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:42.040
other school idols
are working hard just like us.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.380
It's kind of invigorating, isn't it?

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.840
It makes us feel like 
we have lots of friends.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.430
Ruby...

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.100
Maybe you did something that ticked her off?

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.180
Of course not!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.310
Yes, Miss?

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.060
Ah, we're okay.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:03.020
But it appeared to me that
they were definitely hiding something.

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.570
Splitting from the other members
and staying at Saint Snow's house...

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.740
Don't tell me...!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.450
Sis... The truth is...

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.200
We'll fall from Aqours, and...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.240
...starting today...

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.200
...we'll become Saint Aqours Snow!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.250
Bzzzzt!

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.370
Are you okay, Miss?!

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.790
C-Calm down.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.470
It was a joke.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.590
I don't think that's what's going on.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.210
What?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.800
They're probably...

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.470
They're probably...?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.010
Hmmm... I'll keep my mouth shut.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.510
I think you'll know soon.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:40.260
Noooo!

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.980
So this is your room?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.900
You can make yourself at home,
but don't touch--

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:50.620
Wow! This is pretty, <i>zura</i>!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.990
Don't touch it without asking!

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.950
A snow crystal?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:03.210
Right. I looked for them with my sister
on a snowy day when we were small.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:09.510
The moment we decided
to become school idols together,

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:14.470
we decided to have a snow crystal
as the symbol of Saint Snow.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:21.740
And yet... when it was her last Love Live...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:24.650
It's pretty.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.650
Of course! My sister found it.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:33.240
See? She's better than your sister.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.990
That's not true! My sis can find
an outfit I'll look good in in no time flat!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:42.080
The outfits my sister finds for me
are infinity times cuter!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.540
That's not...! Ah...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.790
We've never seen Ruby-<i>chan</i>...

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.040
...this aggressive before!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:49.840
Th-That's...

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:53.260
Seriously. When it comes to her sister,
she gets worked up easily.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.050
So do you... you know.

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.050
You may be right.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.480
You guys really don't have to go back?

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.900
Ah, no, we're fine.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:11.860
There's something really important

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.780
the other members asked us
to take care of here, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.260
Oh, I see.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:21.540
I'm sorry that we
came barging in so suddenly.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.750
That's no problem for us at all.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.040
Well then, I'll let you know
when dinner is ready.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.280
Please don't mind us.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.340
Phew. We somehow managed to fool her.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.840
Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> had...

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.760
...a normal conversation!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:40.460
It's Yohane! And I had no choice
since I couldn't depend on you two!

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.660
I had no choice!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.350
Fallen angels know how to blend into society.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.730
Everyone has an unexpected side.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.320
I'd like you to refer to it
as my hidden magical power!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.250
Back to normal already, <i>zura</i>.

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:55.780
But she might be right.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.600
What?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.430
I've been thinking lately that
though I may appear undependable

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.490
in the eyes of my sister
and the other older members,

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.580
I may have lots of hidden powers.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.420
Then, it's decided, <i>zura</i>!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.290
What is?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.250
The theme of the song, <i>zura</i>!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.130
They aren't coming home yet?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:18.880
They called earlier and told me
that they'd stay there a bit longer.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.830
Don't tell me that they're
going to form a new group...

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.480
I wouldn't put it past that fallen angel...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.100
Your eyes are serious.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.600
Don't worry!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.520
You don't have to worry.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.860
Chika-<i>chan</i>, you sounded like
you knew something the other day.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.390
Did they tell you something?

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.230
It's not that they told me anything.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:47.890
I just thought that they might be
trying to do something all by themselves.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.460
"Once I've decided to do my best..."

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.050
The next line is, "I definitely won't lose."

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.590
And then... like this. What do you think?

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.510
--Do it this way...
--Then...

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.590
And then...

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:00.940
We'd finish it off with...

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.550
Finished!

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.140
Yep. This is really good!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:10.600
--Wooooo... We did it!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.270
--Quiet!
--Wooooo... We did it!

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:16.110
You can still eat it, <i>zura</i>.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.070
--Now...
--Let's hope that we can register for the event.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.360
You have to qualify to participate?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.490
Yeah. We have to explain
the content so they can decide

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:29.040
"Christmas Event Performers
Selection Meeting"

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:28.190
whether or not it's suited for the event.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.960
I'm not good at talking with strangers.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:36.500
Me, neither.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.760
You're up soon, <i>zura</i>.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.580
To think that not having my sister
with me makes me this nervous...

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:48.100
But you guys need to do 
this all by yourselves.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.280
Otherwise, it'll all be meaningless.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.870
Thank you.

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.190
Next group, please come in.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:03.220
--Let's go... by ourselves!
--Let's go... by ourselves!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.160
H-Hello...

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:14.960
I-I..., no, I mean, we... Um...

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.680
Sis...

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.000
Hurry! Hurry!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.650
Sis!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.940
You are such a crybaby, Ruby.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:45.780
You're a strong girl, aren't you?
Now, show me your courage.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:58.150
Right... She's been giving me
courage all this time.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.090
Sis...

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.430
We are from school idol groups.

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.180
Although our groups live far apart,
the two of us

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:19.900
would like to sing a new song
hand in hand for this Christmas event.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:23.440
A song that we dedicate 
to the ones we love...

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.070
Why are you crying, <i>zura</i>?

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.240
Look who's talking!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.840
<i>Zura</i>...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.860
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:44.510
You both did a good job
in the selection meeting, <i>zura</i>.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:50.510
I shall confer you the title
of Little Demon Number Ten.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.470
Gee, thanks.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:56.690
But I wonder if it was really okay
to say something like that...

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.600
We had no choice.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.900
We felt like we had to promise we'd draw
a big crowd or they wouldn't pick us.

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.860
Oh, very well... If the worst comes to pass,
I'll summon my little--

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:07.110
Where are they, <i>zura</i>?

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.660
Shut up! Hm? You're eating again, Zuramaru?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.440
This is delicious, <i>zura</i>.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.450
The signs are indeed everywhere.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.410
--Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>...
--Let me tell you something.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.250
--Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.
--Weight management
is important for school idols.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:23.760
--Yoshiko-<i>chan</i>.
--Don't come crying and--
Quiet! And it's Yohane!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.930
There are some signs you missed, <i>zura</i>.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:32.080
I noticed it while watching you...

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.230
--<i>Zura</i>!
--Eek!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:43.110
--Why, cruel world?!
--That hurt, <i>zura</i>!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:46.990
Ah, that's right.
Did you contact Mari-<i>chan</i>, <i>zura</i>?

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.990
Yep! I just received an email from her.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:53.200
She said they'd definitely like
to help us out with that.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.450
To Hakodate?

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.540
Yeah. Could you go
and bring those three home?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:02.040
It seems like they're worried
about being by themselves after all.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.570
Seriously...

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.260
Whatever will we do with them...

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:12.180
Today, we have the performers
for the Christmas Festival... um...

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.430
It's Saint Aqours Snow.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.350
They came to say hello!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:17.270
Eek!

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.180
That's totally a straightforward name, <i>zura</i>.

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:20.190
In the north,

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.980
--on the night the bell tolls for the dead
to rise up and the barrier to be restored,

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.150
--Let's make the announcement, <i>zura</i>.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.150
--on the night the bell tolls for the dead
to rise up and the barrier to be restored,

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.570
--Yep.
--I call upon my little demons...

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.610
We'll hold a concert on Christmas Eve.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:32.780
Ah! Please, <i>zu</i>-- I mean, come, <i>zu</i>--

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.370
I mean, please come, <i>zura</i>...! Ah...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.290
Ahh... I screwed up, <i>zura</i>.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.670
It's all right, Hanamaru-<i>chan</i>.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.380
Hm? Those two girls...

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.380
Who are they?

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:50.900
My classmates.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.390
Why are you hiding?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:58.460
Because I've never really talked to them.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.150
There'll be a Saint Snow concert!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.740
Leah-<i>chan</i> will perform!

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:08.320
Wha...

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.570
Leah-<i>chan</i>...

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.320
Is it okay if we come to see it, too?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.640
What...? Yeah.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:21.000
And... I know it's late, but I'm sorry
about the Love Live regional prelims.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:26.290
No worries. We're sorry that we
couldn't come to see your performance.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:28.630
We thought you didn't like us.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:33.270
We know that you and Sarah-<i>sempai</i>
worked hard for all of us.

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:38.810
Saint Snow is our pride...
actually, the pride of the whole school.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.390
You'll be performing
in the Christmas Festival, right?

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:43.670
Everyone wants to come. Is that okay?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.730
Yes.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.240
Don't cry, Leah-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:01.290
I wonder why...
I feel happy, but tears come out.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.390
I can't wait to see my sis.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:12.930
Sarah-<i>san</i>?

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.760
Oh? What're you doing here?

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.720
Well... I was told to come here.

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.570
What? Actually, so was I.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.940
"To my sis Dia"
"To my sister Sarah"

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:34.280
What is this?

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:35.700
It's a Christmas...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.950
...present.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:41.240
Leah-<i>chan</i> and I will hold
a concert on Christmas Eve...

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:46.420
On the stage we created by ourselves
using everything you taught me...

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.790
We want you two to see
how far we were able to come...

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.220
...by ourselves...

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.720
Excuse me...

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.260
My little demons say
that they want to see it, too.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.970
Who're you calling little demons?!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.020
Chika-<i>chan</i>! Everyone...!

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.730
You're here, too?

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:09.730
Mari-<i>chan</i> said she'd pay for the plane
tickets, so we should all go together.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:14.030
Of course! There's no way
that we'd miss an event like this!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.440
That's our Mari! Such a big heart!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.070
Yoshiko-<i>chan</i> is big everywhere, <i>zura</i>.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.160
Ahhhh!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.290
--Sis...
--Sis...

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.300
--Will you watch
the concert we're creating?
--Will you watch the concert we're creating?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.590
Of course.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.920
I'll be happy to.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.230
Yep!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.930
Ahh! I wonder what kind 
of concert it'll be...

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:44.430
I can't wait to see it!

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:50.600
Well then, we should get ready, too,
for the next surprise.

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:51.350
--Yep!
--Yep!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.250
Yeah!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.780
Though it'll be a secret to those two.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.320
The costumes are perfect, too, <i>zura</i>!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:04.270
I bet their concert will be
as incredible as this scenery.

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:10.460
--Sis!
--Sis!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:17.260
We'll shine with everything we have!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:18.500
Please watch it!

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.350
--Merry Christmas!
--Merry Christmas!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:42.030
<i>When</i> <i>I</i> <i>start, I never really think about</i>

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:48.080
<i>How</i> <i>it'll</i> <i>end</i> <i>or</i> <i>anything like that</i>

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:54.080
<i>It seems like it'll go on forever,</i>
<i>so</i> <i>I</i> <i>only</i> <i>look</i> <i>ahead</i>

00:19:54.080 --> 00:20:00.130
<i>Since</i> <i>that's</i> <i>how</i>
<i>I've</i> <i>been</i> <i>running</i> <i>until now</i>

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:12.310
<i>Where,</i> <i>where, where shall I go next?</i>

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.080
<i>Come</i> <i>on!</i> <i>Awaken the power, yeah!</i>

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.210
<i>Are</i> <i>you</i> <i>ready?</i> <i>Let's</i> <i>go!!</i>

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:39.250
<i>Even</i> <i>though I'm supposed</i>
<i>to know a lot of words</i>

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:44.390
<i>At</i> <i>times</i> <i>like</i> <i>this, they won't come out</i>

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:49.390
<i>My</i> <i>heart</i> <i>is filled</i>
<i>with these strong emotions</i>

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:54.730
<i>And</i> <i>I</i> <i>feel</i> <i>like I'll cry</i>
<i>before I can say anything</i>

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:59.860
<i>Once I've decided to do my best</i>
<i>(I</i> <i>definitely</i> <i>won't</i> <i>lose)</i>

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:04.150
<i>I've always worked hard with everyone</i>
<i>(I</i> <i>definitely won't lose)</i>

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:09.450
<i>I</i> <i>won't</i> <i>know that I can't do it until I try</i>

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:13.750
<i>What I'm aiming for inside me</i>
<i>is a new power</i>

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.000
<i>My</i> <i>power,</i> <i>new</i> <i>power,</i> <i>yeah!</i>

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:22.550
<i>I'm sure the world is shining</i>
<i>with unknown power</i>

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.930
<i>So</i> <i>I'll</i> <i>keep</i> <i>on dreaming forever</i>

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:32.310
<i>I'm sure the world is shining</i>
<i>with unknown power</i>

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:36.100
<i>What</i> <i>I'll</i> <i>choose depends on me</i>

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.730
<i>Wake up, my new power</i>

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.690
<i>The</i> <i>power</i> <i>sleeping within me</i>
<i>starts to move</i>

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:46.070
<i>Start</i> <i>up now,</i>
<i>don't just stand there, let's go!</i>

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:51.290
<i>Where,</i> <i>where,</i> <i>where shall I go?</i>

00:21:51.290 --> 00:22:07.220
<i>My</i> <i>power, new power,</i>
<i>in the depths of my heart</i>

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:20.690
<i>My power, new power,</i>
<i>looking for a new world</i>

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:27.780
<i>Wake</i> <i>up,</i> <i>wake</i> <i>up,</i> <i>my new world</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:44.170
Sis... I'm going to quit 
Saint Snow after all.

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:45.040
What?

00:22:45.670 --> 00:22:49.260
Because it is a memory I made with you.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:54.270
Like a snow crystal,
there will only ever be one Saint Snow.

00:22:57.350 --> 00:23:01.860
So I'll find a different snow crystal
by forming a new group.

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:06.610
I'll create a school idol group
that you and everyone else will love.

00:23:07.240 --> 00:23:08.240
Just you watch.

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:11.870
I will.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:24.550
Leah has always been shy
and had a hard time speaking with others.

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:27.660
I guess they aren't
really kids any longer, are they?

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:28.920
I guess not.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:33.730
Their spreading their wings
calls for a celebration.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:38.980
Next Time! "Finding a Way to Shine."

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:41.500
"#10 'Finding a Way to Shine'"
